                  (I fixed the "not an identity column" error from your previous attempt).
              </p>
              <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                  <button 
                    onClick={copyMasterFixSql} 
                    className="bg-yellow-400 hover:bg-yellow-300 text-sky-950 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-black text-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg active:scale-95"
                  >
                      <Copy size={18} /> Copy New Fix SQL
                  </button>
                  <button 
                    onClick={() => setShowFixSql(!showFixSql)} 
                    className="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
                  >
                      <Info size={18} /> {showFixSql ? 'Hide Script' : 'View Script'}
                  </button>
              </div>
              {showFixSql && (
                  <pre className="mt-6 bg-black/40 text-sky-300 p-6 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono overflow-x-auto border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm">
